  "description": "A modern, asynchronous .NET client library for the Billbee API. Built with Flurl.Http and Polly for robust HTTP communication with automatic retry policies and circuit breaker patterns.",
  "id": "Billbee.Net",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-05-18T19:00:16.347Z",
